From: TSDuck upstream e8649a16f5c1eb46e92d5790ad39afe6782e6210
Subject: Fix disabled CURL and OpenSSL implementations for the 3.45 SDK

https://github.com/tsduck/tsduck/commit/e8649a16f5c1eb46e92d5790ad39afe6782e6210
Only the two disabled-feature fixes are backported; no SDK version change.

